diagram(dir="right" lang="en")
  title Shop platform
    | Production · eu-west-3 · 106 resources
    |.pill prod
  card#users Customers
    to(alb) HTTPS
  zone#vpc.net VPC 10.20.0.0/16
    | 3 availability zones
    card#alb(label="Load balancer") shop-prod
      to(api) :8080
    card#api(label="ECS service") api
  zone#sec(at="s") Security
    card#kms(label="KMS key") alias/shop
      | encrypts RDS, SQS, S3
  zone#ops(at="s") Monitoring
    card#alarms(label="CloudWatch") 3 alarms
      to(sns)
    card#sns(label="SNS topic") alerts
  card#key.legend(at="ne") Key
    |.net network
  card.text.wide(at="s")
    | Omitted for clarity: route tables, IAM policy attachments.
